msgstr "Workers concurrentes"


#. translators: 1: server RAM in MB, 2: worker size in MB.
#: src/Admin/AuditPage.php:223
#, php-format
msgid ""
"estimate at %1$s MB of pool RAM and %2$s MB per worker — adjust both below"
msgstr "estimación con %1$s MB de RAM para el pool y %2$s MB por worker: ajusta ambos abajo"


#: src/Admin/AuditPage.php:233
msgid "Object cache bandwidth"
msgstr "Ancho de banda de la caché de objetos"


#. translators: 1: requests per second, 2: gigabytes per day.
#: src/Admin/AuditPage.php:237
#, php-format
msgid ""
"alloptions lives under one key, so the whole blob crosses the wire per "
"request — %1$s req/s, %2$s GB/day"
msgstr "alloptions vive bajo una sola clave, así que el blob entero cruza la red en cada petición: %1$s pet/s, %2$s GB/día"


#: src/Admin/AuditPage.php:256
msgid ""
"The unserialization and memory figures are measurements taken on this "
"machine, on this PHP build, against your own option. The worker and "
"bandwidth figures are arithmetic on top of them and are only as good as the "
"two inputs you give them."
msgstr "Las cifras de deserialización y memoria son medidas tomadas en esta máquina, con esta compilación de PHP, contra tu propia opción. Las de workers y ancho de banda son aritmética sobre ellas, y valen solo lo que valgan los dos datos que les des."


#: src/Admin/AuditPage.php:274
msgid "Requests per second"
msgstr "Peticiones por segundo"


#: src/Admin/AuditPage.php:280
msgid "Pool RAM (MB)"
msgstr "RAM del pool (MB)"


#: src/Admin/AuditPage.php:286
msgid "Per worker (MB)"
msgstr "Por worker (MB)"


